-/**
- * Matches the two supported callee shapes for `Icon.select(...)`:
- *   - `<IconBinding>.select(...)`        — `import { Icon } from '@expo/ui'`
- *   - `<NsBinding>.Icon.select(...)`     — `import * as ExpoUI from '@expo/ui'`
